All four methods discussed in this article are open source:

- **PaCMAP** — <https://github.com/YingfanWang/PaCMAP>
- **LocalMAP** — <https://github.com/williamsyy/LocalMAP/tree/localmap>
- **ParamRepulsor** — <https://github.com/hyhuang00/ParamRepulsor>
- **RashomonDR** — <https://github.com/williamsyy/RashomonDR>
